  'soy leghemoglobin': { risk: IngredientRisk.Medium, category: 'proteins', explanation: 'Heme-like protein from soy root nodules produced by fermentation (the "bleeding" ingredient in Impossible Burger); FDA "no questions" GRAS letter 2019 but classified as a color additive — novel ingredient with limited long-term human data.' },
