  'grass fed and finished beef': { risk: IngredientRisk.Low, category: 'meats', explanation: 'Beef from cattle raised and finished exclusively on grass; the highest quality designation for pasture beef — 2–5× higher in omega-3 fatty acids and CLA than conventional grain-finished beef.' },
